{
  "doc": "stages/writers.fbi.rst: 'Support for all point attributes in LAS 1.2 format so data can be converted between LAS 1.2 and Fast Binary formats without any loss of point attribute information.' -- ReturnNumber and PointSourceId are LAS 1.2 point attributes too. In grid.las ReturnNumber is (i % 3) + 1 and PointSourceId is X + 1, so a lossy round trip would show up as fewer than three distinct return numbers or fewer than ten source ids.",
